      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        1672,
        1617,
        1881
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "For those who wish to go together in buses these are available for round trips from Times Square at a price of $4.50 including both the bus fare and a $4.80 seat for the show. However, there must be exactly 45 persons as the bus drivers will not contract for fewer seats at this price -- and 45 is the bus capacity.",
